from pathlib import Path
p=Path('outputs/3d/README.md')
with p.open('a',encoding='utf-8') as f:f.write('\n## Optional charity, bank loans, and Finances\nCharity now offers Donate (two dice on the next roll) or Pass (one die); unaffordable donations are disabled. Unaffordable deals offer a reviewed bank loan or Pass. The game bank lends in $1,000 steps, charging $100/month per step as interest; principal can be repaid in $1,000 steps from Finances. Interest is included in expenses, payday and the financial-freedom calculation. Finances now uses the animated cream-and-gold card style with cashflow, debt and repayment controls. Tests cover choice outcomes, confirmation, duplicate-click guards, interest, repayment and resetting debt for a new game, plus the five-resolution board regression.\n')
